OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785833289
OL,3,CFurther water restrictions possible as
OL,4,CSouthern Water applies for Drought
OL,5,COrder
OL,7,FSouthern Water says further
OL,8,Frestrictions on water use could be
OL,9,Fbrought in, following the official
OL,10,Fdeclaration of drought in Hampshire
OL,11,Fand the Isle of Wight.
OL,13,FThe company says more than 12.5
OL,14,Fmillion litres of water has been
OL,15,Frecovered since the hosepipe ban was
OL,16,Fintroduced a month ago.
OL,18,FThat's enough to fill five Olympic
OL,19,Fswimming pools.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
