FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785833289
OL,3,CFurther water restrictions possible as
OL,4,CSouthern Water applies for Drought
OL,5,COrder
OL,7,FBut with river levels still falling,
OL,8,Fit's now applying for a Drought Order,
OL,9,Fand Non-Essential Use Ban, which would
OL,10,Faffect businesses.
OL,12,FIf a NEUB is put in place, businesses
OL,13,Fmust stop using water for a number of
OL,14,Factivities including filling or
OL,15,Fmaintaining a non-domestic swimming
OL,16,Fpool or paddling pool, operating a
OL,17,Fmechanical vehicle washer and cleaning
OL,18,Fwindows.
OL,20,FA consultation will begin tomorrow.
OL,21,F(Tuesday 4 August)
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
