PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785833289
OL,3,CFurther water restrictions possible as
OL,4,CSouthern Water applies for Drought
OL,5,COrder
OL,7,FA Southern Water spokesperson said:
OL,8,F"We're doing everything possible to
OL,9,Fprotect water supplies, having reduced
OL,10,Fleakage by almost 30% over the past
OL,11,Ftwo years and achieved the third-
OL,12,Flowest leakage per property of any
OL,13,Fwater company in England.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785833289
OL,3,CFurther water restrictions possible as
OL,4,CSouthern Water applies for Drought
OL,5,COrder
OL,7,F"We're also helping customers save
OL,8,Fwater through our 'You Save, We Pay'
OL,9,Fscheme, carrying out targeted water-
OL,10,Fefficiency visits for non-household
OL,11,Fcustomers, and investing in major
OL,12,Finfrastructure projects, including a
OL,13,Fnew reservoir and water recycling, to
OL,14,Fstrengthen water resilience for future
OL,15,Fgenerations.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
