PN,38605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785833289
OL,3,CFurther water restrictions possible as
OL,4,CSouthern Water applies for Drought
OL,5,COrder
OL,7,F"Due to the ongoing dry weather, and
OL,8,Ffollowing the declaration of drought
OL,9,Fin Hampshire and the Isle of Wight, we
OL,10,Fhave reached the trigger level
OL,11,Frequiring us to apply to Defra for a
OL,12,FDrought Order and Non-Essential Use
OL,13,FBan in these areas.
OL,15,F"These are precautionary measures and
OL,16,Fmaking an application does not mean
OL,17,Fthey will be introduced.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
