OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785833289
OL,3,CFurther water restrictions possible as
OL,4,CSouthern Water applies for Drought
OL,5,COrder
OL,7,F"However, we must follow the
OL,8,Fregulatory process to protect water
OL,9,Fsupplies and the environment if dry
OL,10,Fconditions persist.
OL,12,F"Protecting the River Test remains a
OL,13,Fpriority, and any future drought
OL,14,Fmeasures would be subject to strict
OL,15,Fenvironmental monitoring and controls."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/6
